title: $:/tags/hypergsd/Strip

<!-- Tag list for $hgsd.list's view strip (the Sort by / Group by row): members render as the strip's leading controls, ahead of the Sort by select, on the ONE list each member names. Binding: a member carries `hgsd-strip-host` = the host list's HEADING TEXT — the engine's per-list identity (view-state and list-default key on it; the chassis transclusion does not rebind currentTiddler, so no title-based binding reaches the strip) — so a strip control ships with its list, follows it onto every surface that heading renders on, and never leaks onto other lists. Renaming the heading detaches members exactly as it resets the list's view state. Members are wikitext, transcluded inline. They render OUTSIDE the strip's choice-buster gate: a member-hosted popup/reveal must keep refreshing on its own state writes, and the choice gate (buster-only, no whitelist) would freeze it shut — the state prefixes a strip member's controls write must therefore ride the row gate here and the chassis gates above (the contextualise and tickler-popup precedent: a sub-plugin surface may need main-plugin gate runs). Membership follows plugin-refresh semantics like other shipped structure. Ordering: this list field, then alphabetical. -->